        a sci:EvidenceLine ;
        skos:prefLabel "Cross-model Selgrade/Harris-Clark DDE period sensitivity independently corroborates the distributed-emergent, no-rate-limiting-node menstrual period (top param 27% of |S|, 0/37 cycle-breakers) — but the node-weighting does not generalise (DDE follicular-weighted, reproduces the FSH law)" ;
        skos:related <http://example.org/project/evidence-line/0016-gyncycle-sensitivity-supports-distributed-emergent-period>,
            <http://example.org/project/evidence-line/0017-gyncycle-global-sensitivity-corroborates-distributed-period>,
